+# Image generation prompts: styles 33–36
+
+Generated with the built-in image generation tool. Every image was generated fresh from text without any reference images. Final PNG files were resized to 1024 × 1024 with sips.
+
+## styles/33-surrealism.png
+
+Create one square 1024x1024 image, generated entirely fresh from this text with no reference image. Salvador Dalí surrealist oil painting: hyper-detailed dreamlike realism painted with exquisitely precise oil glazes, impossible soft objects, disquieting scale, endless desert and long razor-sharp shadows. A woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater enjoys a coffee. Let authentic surrealism fully dictate anatomy, pose, perspective, composition and color. Use a wide desolate dream landscape with a low horizon; show the woman seated in profile in the middle distance with elongated, dream-distorted proportions. Her coffee cup melts and droops luxuriously over its saucer; soft melting clocks hang across an eroded ledge; delicate wooden crutches support impossible objects; a detailed croissant floats nearby in defiance of gravity. Vast ochre earth, distant blue ridges, green-blue sky, merciless raking light. Make this a deeply strange museum oil painting, not a photograph with a filter or a conventional cafe portrait. No text, clock numerals, captions, signatures, logos or watermarks.
+
+## styles/34-mexican-folk.png
+
+Create one square 1024x1024 image, generated entirely fresh from this text with no reference image. Frida Kahlo-inspired Mexican folk painting, with a frontal self-portrait pose, flat naive style, vivid pink, green and orange, deliberately flattened space, firm contours and visible handmade brushwork. The subject is a woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater, enjoying coffee. Compose a still, iconic waist-up frontal portrait, eyes looking straight outward, hands embracing a small coffee cup at her chest, a croissant resting on a little foreground plate. Frame her closely with monkeys, parrots, orange marigolds and green cacti in an abundant, intimate and symmetrical folk-art garden. Her own auburn curls, glasses and freckles must remain recognizable; retain her own identity rather than depicting Frida herself. The art style controls proportions and anatomy: hieratic pose, sculpted simplified face, patterned foliage and brush-painted textures, all on a shallow decorative picture plane. An authentic painted folk portrait, not a photograph, digital rendering or photo filter. No text, captions, signatures or watermarks.
+
+## styles/35-warhol.png
+
+Create one square 1024x1024 image, generated entirely fresh from this text with no reference image. Andy Warhol silkscreen pop art: an exact 3 by 3 grid containing nine repeats of the SAME tightly cropped portrait, with the SAME pose and silhouette in every tile, reprinted in nine radically clashing neon color combinations. The subject is a woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater enjoying a coffee, with a croissant nearby. Frame each repeat as a large head and shoulders, her face turned slightly three-quarter, smiling as she raises a small coffee cup close to her lips, a small croissant visible at the bottom beside the cup. Hair curls, round glasses, freckles and knit collar become bold stencil motifs. Translate natural colors freely into pop-art spot inks; keep mustard yellow sweater accents, auburn-origin curl shapes and tortoiseshell glasses motifs recognizable while allowing the screenprint palette to dominate. Magenta against acid green, cyan against blazing orange, electric blue against yellow, scarlet against violet; nine different ink combinations. Flat color blocks, strong coarse black stencil shapes, dry ink grain and slight ink misregistration, a physically printed silkscreen artwork with emphatically graphic simplification. Edge-to-edge grid, no gutters or decorative frame. No photographic tonal rendering, no soft shading, no text, captions, signatures or watermarks.
+
+## styles/36-disney-2d.png
+
+Create one square 1024x1024 image, generated entirely fresh from this text with no reference image. Authentic 1990s Disney Renaissance hand-drawn 2D animation: a princess-like expressive original woman with large expressive eyes, graceful exaggerated anatomy, fluid cel animation poses, elegant clean colored ink outlines and crisp flat cel fills with restrained hand-painted shadow shapes, against a lush painted Parisian background in magical warm light. The woman is in her early 30s, with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater. She joyfully enjoys coffee and has a croissant nearby. Create a full-body narrative animation scene: seen from a lively oblique low angle, she is seated sideways at a little outdoor Paris cafe table, one leg playfully extended, torso and face in a lively three-quarter/profile turn, raising a porcelain coffee cup with relaxed delight; the croissant rests clearly on a plate on her little table. Curl shapes flow in sweeping arcs and her free arm makes a graceful expressive gesture. Layer wrought-iron cafe chairs, cobblestones, flowering window boxes and softly painted Parisian buildings into rich theatrical depth. Warm amber sunset, honey highlights, airy blue and lavender background shadows. This must look like a beautiful production animation cel over a traditional painted background, with stylization controlling all anatomy, proportion and framing. No photorealism, no 3D, no photo filter, no text anywhere, no lettering on cafe facades, no captions, signatures or watermarks.
+

